# =============================================================================
# CODEOWNERS — Automatic Code Review Assignment
# =============================================================================
# When a PR modifies files matching a pattern, the listed users/teams are
# automatically added as reviewers.
#
# Syntax:
#   pattern    @user @org/team
#
# Patterns are evaluated in order; the last matching pattern takes precedence.
# More specific patterns override less specific ones.
#
# For teams: @org/team-name (e.g., @yt-player/backend, @yt-player/frontend)
# For users: @username
# =============================================================================


